22 usage error or invalid setting.

Examples:
  $SCRIPT_NAME -v                              # this host
  $SCRIPT_NAME -L id --mail ops@example.com srv1 srv2
  $SCRIPT_NAME -m claude-sonnet-5-5 -e high srv1
  $SCRIPT_NAME -n srv1 | less                  # see what would be sent
